{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the trial version of <strong>Miyuuri's Cozy Hours</strong>, which includes:20 out of 80 music tracks\u300110 out of 30 white noise options\u3001Pomodoro Timer\u3001To-Do List\u3001Calendar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miyuuri's Cozy Hours</strong> is an ultra-compact gamified focus tool. Here, you can improve concentration and relieve stress through features like fishing, customizing your personal space, character outfits, flow-state tools, letters, and pet companions\u2014making real life more enjoyable.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your cozy space, customize your character, and enjoy the company of cute pets!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change wallpapers, furniture, and wall decorations to create your ideal 2D comfort zone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of clothing, hairstyles, accessories, and customization options to express your unique style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and try the gacha system to collect adorable pets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973270/extras/2a29e1019cc81dedb83abe49bd277108.poster.avif?t=1757927522\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973270/extras/2a29e1019cc81dedb83abe49bd277108.apng?t=1757927522\" class=\"bb_img\" width=478 height=223 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Relaxed Fishing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, just easy and enjoyable fishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973270/extras/a19211be8894a45e